Come here!

831
01:10:29,886 --> 01:10:31,555
Maybe I'm on a roll...

832
01:10:31,596 --> 01:10:33,599
...and I'll kill every damn Sawyer I see.

833
01:10:40,022 --> 01:10:42,192
Jed, Jed...

834
01:10:43,983 --> 01:10:48,197
<i>Jed... Are you okay down there?

835
01:10:50,865 --> 01:10:51,867
<i>Jed?

836
01:10:51,991 --> 01:10:53,494
<i>Come on, now.

837
01:10:57,540 --> 01:10:58,500
Hold on.

838
01:10:58,582 --> 01:11:01,209
Come on, we've got you. We've got you, Jed.

839
01:12:18,994 --> 01:12:22,207
This will hold it together while it heals...

840
01:12:24,500 --> 01:12:26,336
All right, you're going to feel this...

841
01:12:26,460 --> 01:12:27,960
I'm going to pull it pretty tight.

842
01:12:36,803 --> 01:12:38,097
All right...

843
01:12:44,101 --> 01:12:45,311
Jed...

844
01:13:19,218 --> 01:13:20,762
I'll help you.

845
01:13:22,930 --> 01:13:24,850
I swear.

846
01:13:26,933 --> 01:13:29,437
Untie me, please...

847
01:13:30,729 --> 01:13:32,106
Please...

848
01:13:33,023 --> 01:13:34,316
Why?

849
01:13:41,113 --> 01:13:43,409
What were you going to do to me?

850
01:13:45,995 --> 01:13:47,539
I don't know...

851
01:13:52,960 --> 01:13:56,921
I'm sorry, I am...

852
01:14:06,431 --> 01:14:08,185
Jesus Christ!

853
01:14:10,477 --> 01:14:11,896
Let's go...

854
01:14:23,616 --> 01:14:25,493
<i>Nubbins, come here.

855
01:14:37,463 --> 01:14:38,757
Bring your brother something to eat.

856
01:14:38,798 --> 01:14:40,048
All right.

857
01:14:46,595 --> 01:14:48,473
<i>They're gone! They're gone!

858
01:14:53,061 --> 01:14:54,688
Go, go...

859
01:15:02,194 --> 01:15:04,614
No!

860
01:15:04,697 --> 01:15:05,991
Leave her alone!

861
01:15:06,366 --> 01:15:07,785
No.

862
01:15:08,952 --> 01:15:10,870
Hurry, bring him.

863
01:15:20,045 --> 01:15:21,345
You messed with the wrong family!

864
01:15:21,380 --> 01:15:23,843
Yeah, you're proud of this damn family, aren't
you?

865
01:15:25,007 --> 01:15:26,051
Jed!

866
01:15:29,053 --> 01:15:30,431
Jed!

867
01:15:42,526 --> 01:15:44,404
Oh, fuck!

868
01:15:51,159 --> 01:15:53,454
What are you going to do?

869
01:16:04,172 --> 01:16:05,799
It's not over, boy!

870
01:16:06,049 --> 01:16:07,342
Goddamn it!

871
01:16:08,758 --> 01:16:10,552
This isn't over, damn it! You hear me?

872
01:16:10,634 --> 01:16:13,598
Jed, what have I told you about strangers?

873
01:16:13,764 --> 01:16:15,725
They fill your ears with lies...

874
01:16:15,766 --> 01:16:17,643
Show them who you are, Jed.

875
01:16:18,935 --> 01:16:21,439
Look what that man did to your face!

876
01:16:27,068 --> 01:16:28,653
Jackson, don't do it!

877
01:16:30,447 --> 01:16:32,116
No!

878
01:16:32,199 --> 01:16:34,243
Shut up. You're next, you hear me?

879
01:16:34,284 --> 01:16:35,244
Fuck you!

880
01:16:35,744 --> 01:16:37,372
No!

881
01:16:44,960 --> 01:16:46,171
No!

882
01:17:51,402 --> 01:17:52,820
Go, go, go! Get her now!

883
01:17:52,855 --> 01:17:53,697
Go get her!

884
01:17:55,239 --> 01:17:57,993
Jed, remember what I told you? Go get her.

885
01:17:58,200 --> 01:17:59,119
Get her, Jed!

886
01:18:00,453 --> 01:18:02,080
Nobody messes with our family!

887
01:19:50,893 --> 01:19:53,105
Help me!

888
01:19:56,315 --> 01:19:59,111
No!

889
01:20:17,712 --> 01:20:19,297
Jackson, don't do this!

890
01:20:20,630 --> 01:20:22,967
Please, don't do this!

891
01:20:24,092 --> 01:20:25,636
I tried to help you...

892
01:20:26,011 --> 01:20:27,805
That's all I ever tried to do.

893
01:20:28,055 --> 01:20:29,432
You know that, right?

894
01:20:30,140 --> 01:20:32,518
Listen to me, it's not too late...

895
01:20:32,976 --> 01:20:34,769
We can still get out of here together.

896
01:20:35,060 --> 01:20:36,812
That bitch is a liar, Jed!

897
01:20:37,395 --> 01:20:38,856
She doesn't care about you...

898
01:20:39,314 --> 01:20:41,068
Kill her! Kill her now!

899
01:20:41,108 --> 01:20:42,861
Please don't listen to her.

900
01:20:43,819 --> 01:20:45,238
Please.

901
01:20:45,696 --> 01:20:47,157
I know there's good in you...

902
01:20:47,615 --> 01:20:48,741
I've seen it.

903
01:20:49,407 --> 01:20:52,620
Please listen to me. This isn't you, Jackson!

904
01:20:53,870 --> 01:20:55,039
This isn't you!

905
01:20:55,580 --> 01:20:57,167
It's your crazy mother!

906
01:20:57,583 --> 01:20:58,710
It's her...

907
01:21:14,643 --> 01:21:16,187
That's my boy!

908
01:21:16,728 --> 01:21:18,437
You did good, Jed.

909
01:21:22,107 --> 01:21:24,068
You made your mama proud.

910
01:21:27,028 --> 01:21:30,784
<i>No!

911
01:23:52,796 --> 01:24:48,352
<i>Leatherface (2017)
Subtitles by TaMaBin
